[{"title":"初寓横泾","author":"黄顺之","text":"十年泉石梦，及此始依然。\n野迥天垂地，身閒日抵年。\n稍欣闻见少，渐与土风便。\n分得渔樵席，白云相共眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73919,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠陈宗之","author":"黄顺之","text":"羡君家阙下，不踏九衢尘。\n万卷书中坐，一生閒里身。\n贪诗疑有债，阅世欲无人。\n昨日相思处，桐花烂熳春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73920,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听悟师弹招隐","author":"黄顺之","text":"悟师手携清风琴，为我再奏招隐吟。\n九原灵均不可作，后人遗恨空沈沈，令我听之泪沾襟。\n楚山日落秋声起，古猿啼月空山里。\n千年愁气上青枫，幽兰无香桂华死，吾道非耶何至此。\n曲中历历分明道，苦怨王孙负春草。\n岁晚山中难久留，忆君一夕令人老。\n王孙王孙知不知，琴心招君胡不归。\n下沿湘江之水流，上逐湘山之云飞。\n一弹一招一太息，水流云飞朝复夕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73921,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送叶靖逸","author":"黄顺之","text":"山高积雪明，岁序冉以逼。\n佳人抱书去，西湖失颜色。\n清夜独慷慨，诗坛梦生棘。\n我有双鲤鱼，对之不敢食。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73922,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九女山","author":"黄唐","text":"粼粼新绿起前峰，拂拂垂杨烟雨中。\n安得一蓑浮短艇，玉鳞飞上钓丝风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73923,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿徐仓使","author":"黄垺","text":"四明山水远且清，秀气钟作千人英。\n南州高士真济美，天地正粹涵中襟。\n学问渊源派伊洛，文章典丽铿䪫韺。\n射策丹墀压群彦，声名一日蜚玉京。\n粤从膴仕久扬历，政事所至皆有称。\n雠较芸编上群玉，蕃宣苕水腾颂声。\n凝旒简眷异俦正，追班文石焕郎星。\n清规屹立朝誉振，儒术既行邦计赢。\n论思献纳众所瞩，其奈宵旰怀远氓。\n咨诹出揽澄清辔，肃持庾节赒列城。\n视时敛散民食足，观风按察吏胆惊。\n侧听赐环驲骑速，行看荷橐天衢亨。\n节过清明才六日，欣逢吉梦叶长庚。\n和气却随春气足，福星还并寿星明。\n己闻好语日边至，莫辞烂熳倾罍觥。\n自惭小草依松柏，臭味相投意甚真。\n矢诗不但为公寿，八荒寿域更跻民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73924,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酹江月 寿韩元吉","author":"黄宰","text":"三光五岳，孕乾坤英彩，非金非玉。\n赫赫岩岩真相种，来驾横空仙鹄。\n十万儿童，和丰堂下，齐指梅山祝。\n黑头难老，岁寒苍桧修竹。\n须信自家有传，中庸一卷，是长生真箓。\n借问洛阳归去后，几度桃开桃熟。\n十九年间，梦回天上，再见棠阴绿。\n相将促觐，已闻沙路新筑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73925,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 其一 寿留守刘枢密","author":"黄格","text":"富贵不难致，名节几人全。\n渡江龙化，于今，五十有三年。\n历数朝堂诸老，谁似武夷仙伯，操行老弥坚。\n吾道适中否，一柱独擎天。\n湖南北，江左右，屡藩宣。\n韩公城下，烽火静、米斗三钱。\n人愿公归台鼎，我愿公归中隐，九老要齐肩。\n岁岁祝公寿，风月伴梅仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73926,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花绝句 其一","author":"黄珩","text":"丰钟逐散晓云遮，我欲伸冤玉帝家。\n青女一身都是胆，年年随下月偷花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73927,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘后村梅花绝句 其二","author":"黄珩","text":"一双白鹤骑焉往，十万青蚨散即休。\n吟透何郎早春句，输他占射得扬州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73928,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"黄珩","text":"真色果无描写法，汉人枉自杀毛公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73929,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"黄皋","text":"冷斋夜话非无谓，暖日春风足自香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73930,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽文丞相","author":"黄继善","text":"三百馀年乐育恩，晚从科目得斯人。\n崎岖岭海期年国，零落毡毛万死身。\n诸葛未亡犹有汉，包胥欲泣更无秦。\n挑灯忼慨歌梁父，鬓发萧森?鬼神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73931,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 过西湖","author":"黄谈","text":"午风清暑，过西湖隐约，曾游堤路。\n云径烟扉人境绝，真是珠宫玄圃。\n倦倚阑干，笑呼艇子，同入荷花去。\n一杯相属，恍然身在何许。\n休怪梦入巫云，凌波罗袜，我在迷湘浦。\n缥缈惊鸿飞燕举，却怨严城钟鼓。\n百斛明珠，千金骏马，豪气今犹故。\n归来清晓，幅巾犹带香露。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73932,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过长安渡","author":"黄载","text":"重来已过十番秋，更十番秋欲白头。\n无限旧时心里事，青山残照水东流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73933,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"黄载","text":"社寒比腊更清严，花蕊萧疏半欲缄。\n过手重裘犹得力，莫将晴暖信春衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73934,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赣州道上见上坟者 其一","author":"黄载","text":"翠树青烟笑语稠，家家领客醉松楸。\n老翁哭子气欲绝，行到前村更转头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73935,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赣州道上见上坟者 其二","author":"黄载","text":"攫祭乌鸦噪晚田，草芽新染绿如烟。\n墓头寂寂虫鸣急，惟有春风舞纸钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73936,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中梦觉","author":"黄载","text":"梦觉三通鼓，连樯闻欠呵。\n世间半夜后，枕上醒人多。\n思想从天落，悲欢奈晓何。\n南柯莫轻笑，未易到南柯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73937,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"随州沙溪","author":"黄载","text":"石路崎岖石濑鸣，峰峦回合小原平。\n桑麻积雨肥春垄，鸡犬一村喧昼晴。\n田妇共携中饭去，樵童相唤上山声。\n边头今有江南景，十数年来不用兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73938,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岘山","author":"黄载","text":"向来陵谷尚休然，放眼高台万象还。\n南国一池襄汉水，中原千古邓唐山。\n斜阳淡淡飞鸿没，芳草萋萋戎马閒。\n前代英雄亦何许，棹歌日日过沧湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73939,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钟馗观鬼斗蟆图","author":"黄载","text":"谁推酆都扃，逸此魔十二。\n相群斗蟆供戏剧，绡墨何从拂其迹。\n两雄斗于前，四鬼相视欣欣然。\n小蟆对睨摊双膝，筠笼一蟆跳欲出。\n前者差壮一力肩，后者引索擎于拳。\n髯翁磬折目胜负，突眼老妪探头觑。\n就中黄叟如蹲鸱，破帽长袍吾老馗。\n只眼直下看不匝，诸鬼乐与吾翁狎。\n四丁更与蟆之魁，疾驰不能压欲颓。\n蟆肥于豚怒于虎，张颐缩项誇相顾。\n昔时唐宋失天经，妖蟆曾搳天眼精。\n今魔视蟆细于蚁，魔若跳梁那可指。\n群阴胶凝互掀翻，六鳌顶戴愁颠连。\n但能伐魔既厥类，芟夷妖蟆谈笑耳。\n僇妖之事馗所司，何独反与为儿戏。\n不惟失职纵奸宄，鬼祸如蟆将及尔。\n参军参军其然乎，或者好事丹青图。\n谅应馗笑玉川子，诛蟆未诛骨先苦。\n风悲雨凄天地愁，蟆鬼正是相雄秋。\n仅馀一目不可搳，我曷不可相娱说。\n会闻隔帘歌斗蛙，山鬼性命摧红牙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73940,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读旧稿蛙吹集一绝","author":"黄载","text":"蛙吹儿童事，重开已汗颜。\n更须留近作，待过十年看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73941,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪侍丞相安晚先生宿觉际寺夜遇大风可畏遂赋大篇","author":"黄载","text":"船头落日如血红，客言今夕当有风。\n空山梦回刺骨冷，纩被无力身如弓。\n但闻纸窗响僁窣，初意空厨饥鼠出。\n忽然扉户竞开阖，犹谓偷儿入吾室。\n须臾歘作号怒声，鼙鼓百万渔阳鸣。\n室庐动摇地欲转，林木震吼山如崩。\n噫嘻异哉那有此，攲枕恍惚疑梦寐。\n应是钱塘醉未醒，翻海胥涛骋游戏。\n或者客寓紫塞旁，铁骑赴敌古战场。\n不然此处安乐国，何遽隉阢犹乘航。\n起来穴牖目如割，平湖已捲十堆雪。\n乃知跋扈是飞廉，似妒晚来客饶舌。\n因思前年到黄冈，朔风摇江惊断肠。\n骁将忍冻骨比铁，壮士力斗身如汤。\n此身彷佛临皋上，一感还生百惆怅。\n长安贵人正酣眠，日高尚恋销金帐。\n东窗未白鸡未啼，相公自起烧松枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73942,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题大洪山","author":"黄载","text":"地当平旷易为山，故得崔嵬汉沔间。\n云雾涌来无下界，楼台浮起在中天。\n开窗时见雷霆出，隐几閒看日月还。\n更有钟声最堪恨，南风时到八陵边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73943,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东风第一枝 探梅","author":"黄载","text":"迅影凋年，嫩晴贳暖，意行问讯春色。\n不知春在谁家，闯香幔拢玉勒。\n一枝竹外，似欲诉、经年相忆。\n奈情多、难剪愁来，寂寞水寒烟碧。\n吟正好、悲笳唤恨，酒正殢、夕阳催客。\n殷勤片月飞来，更随暗香细索。\n横斜瘦影，看尽未开时消息。\n为春来，还怕春多，肠断夜阑霜笛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73944,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤鸾 四明后圃石峰之下，小池之上，有梅花","author":"黄载","text":"冰心孤寂。\n恋几插灵峰，半泓寒碧。\n骨瘦和衣薄，清绝成愁极。\n萧然满身是雪，怕人知、镜中消息。\n独向百花梦外，自一家春色。\n记罗浮幽梦浑如昔。\n有浸眼鲸波，倚云丹壁。\n夜醉空山酒，叫裂横霜笛。\n回头洞天未晓，但迢迢、江南千驿。\n饮散东风落月，正海山浮碧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73945,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昼锦堂 牡丹","author":"黄载","text":"丽景融晴，浮光起昼，玉妃信意寻春。\n一笑酒杯翻手，满地祥云。\n宝台艳蹙文绡帕，郎官娇舞郁金裙。\n嫣然处，况是生香微湿，腻脸馀醺。\n暖烘肌欲透，愁日炙还销，风动成尘。\n细为品归雪调，度与朱唇。\n翠帏晚映真图画，金莲夜照越精神。\n须拚醉，回首夕阳流水，碧草如茵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73946,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞仙歌","author":"黄载","text":"吴宫故墅，是天开图画。\n缥缈层云出飞榭。\n隐隐楼空翠巘，水绕芜城，平畴迥，点染霜林凋谢。\n越来溪上雁，声切阑干，似觅胥门怨吴霸。\n属镂沈，香溪断，梦散云空，千年外、等是渔樵闲话。\n但极目荒台郁苍烟，衰草里、又还夕阳西下。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73947,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隔浦莲/隔浦莲近拍 荷花","author":"黄载","text":"瑶妃香透袜冷。\n伫立青铜镜。\n玉骨清无汗，亭亭碧波千顷。\n云水摇扇影。\n炎天永。\n一国清凉境。\n晚妆靓。\n微酣不语，风流幽恨谁省。\n沙鸥少事，看到睡鸳双醒。\n兰棹歌遥隔浦应。\n催暝。\n藕丝萦断归艇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73948,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"黄崇义","text":"涧水之西我所家，结亭新借白鸥沙。\n旋移骚国春风木，满种陶篱晚节花。\n陪客常留煨芋火，课儿频煮读书茶。\n清波迥与黄尘隔，一笑人生自有涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73949,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄宫 其一","author":"黄常吉","text":"山锁清溪溪锁峰，溪光山色两怡融。\n松枝点滴衣夹雨，云叶飘扬岩际风。\n玉室金堂端好坐，石坛乳窦自相通。\n我生已幸尘缘薄，拟结茅庐天柱东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73950,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄","author":"黄常吉","text":"我厌城市喧，故作林泉游。\n十事思九错，一笑忘百忧。\n道念岂不定，俗累良未休。\n安得弄泉石，味道老一丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73951,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄宫 其二","author":"黄常吉","text":"乔松苍竹带烟霏，木拱彤檐蔼翠微。\n虚谷玲珑遗凤响，行云蒙密护龙归。\n繁花结绣迷樵径，灵药飘香满客衣。\n更欲支筇遍诸顶，可怜无策驻残晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73952,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝方山二首 其二","author":"黄庵","text":"平生不惯俗尘萦，才对南山眼便青。\n天与诗人张画本，疏梅翠竹小池亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73953,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝方山二首 其一","author":"黄庵","text":"扶藤来访古招提，月壑云天分外奇。\n料得山林暗相贺，苍崖今日有新诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73954,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山水卧屏","author":"黄庶","text":"林泉生长厌应难，更写方屏几曲间。\n仕宦东西苦无定，此心长似宿家山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73955,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋夜月","author":"黄庶","text":"人间共赏中秋月，酒社诗家意味长。\n天上必应霜露早，桂丛凋尽饱青光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73956,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伊川喜雨","author":"黄庶","text":"尺雨乘春慰望深，家家仓廪一年心。\n伊川父老还知否，此是随车傅说霖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73957,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元伯西轩桃李","author":"黄庶","text":"李白桃红气味奢，早须分付醉吟家。\n春风春雨难期信，便是无言做落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73958,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元伯初夏南洋河即事","author":"黄庶","text":"芳菲已去绝音尘，临水踟蹰景又新。\n应是溪源来最远，落花流水洞中春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73959,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元伯晓出白门","author":"黄庶","text":"山形云染翠屏曲，溪色练铺银汉东。\n楼台一轴古今本，行者往来图画中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73960,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵向元伯春晚有作","author":"黄庶","text":"好花未得千场醉，风雨飘零又一春。\n自是劳生无暇日，芳菲何处解孤人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73961,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和真长四季牧童 其一","author":"黄庶","text":"怯雨宜晴不识愁，去随青草牧春牛。\n无人古路歌兼笑，归去山花插满头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73962,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和真长四季牧童 其四","author":"黄庶","text":"枯笛手持无律吕，清风曲调逐时新。\n数竿冬日浑无价，暖靠牛眠不教人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73963,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和真长四季牧童 其二","author":"黄庶","text":"晓牧侵星大暑天，昼寻芳树绿阴眠。\n惜牛不使冲残日，归带黄昏饮小川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73964,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和真长四季牧童 其三","author":"黄庶","text":"角穿黄穗手横笳，不省人间有鬓华。\n落日西风归去路，枯桑黄叶两三家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73965,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵居正四月牡丹","author":"黄庶","text":"四月残红日日稀，平阳园槛正芳菲。\n春知东馆酣宾客，应是阳和未放归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73966,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过朱亥墓","author":"黄庶","text":"枯林寒草墓丘墟，等是当年一丈夫。\n地下若知应笑死，衣冠今日有屠沽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73967,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求郭侍禁水墨树石","author":"黄庶","text":"尘埃典却林泉闲，家梦夜夜归云端。\n知君弄笔欺造化，乞我几株松石看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73968,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵竹","author":"黄庶","text":"绿阴清韵竹萧然，历历当年泣泪痕。\n千古舜妃湘水底，必应憔悴有惭魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73969,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮张承制园亭","author":"黄庶","text":"小园岂是春来晚，四月花飞入酒杯。\n都为主人尤好事，风光留住不教回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73970,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元伯中伏夜雨南洋河水泛","author":"黄庶","text":"雨洗三齐中伏月，乖龙连夜起云门。\n溪声斗似银河落，惊断诗书一梦魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73971,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元伯走马看牡丹","author":"黄庶","text":"城中走马趁残春，诗别馀花句句新。\n何似园家不吟醉，姚黄魏紫属游人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73972,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其六 水鸭","author":"黄庶","text":"忆在山中日，溪边把钓钩。\n相逢恐惊起，招手却回舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73973,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其九 龙潭","author":"黄庶","text":"寂寞真龙去，雩坛血不乾。\n世情多冷暖，对此鼻辛酸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73974,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其三 红树","author":"黄庶","text":"几树浓于茜，斜阳景最幽。\n忽因风雨尽，全减十分秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73975,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其二 牧竖","author":"黄庶","text":"逐处随青草，生来不识愁。\n旱田乾欲死，拍手也须讴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73976,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其八 草市","author":"黄庶","text":"冲市柴鱼集，应山鸡犬号。\n问知人苦乐，米价不多高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73977,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其四 野庙","author":"黄庶","text":"中国浮图盛，祈禳渐不过。\n吾民非独困，山鬼恨尤多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘卿材十咏 其十 溪桥","author":"黄庶","text":"忆得别离日，乡桥柳脚斜。\n读君诗一转，全似到吾家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和百塔寺四首 其四 水阁","author":"黄庶","text":"山僧听泉心不足，凿池汲引为蟾泓。\n自言犹欲洗俗耳，夜静为闻蛙黾声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和百塔寺四首 其一 四开亭","author":"黄庶","text":"亭前流水醒客耳，亭上白云开客颜。\n老僧有意厚来往，四面更令看好山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和柳子玉官舍十首 其六 土榻","author":"黄庶","text":"床前一尺二尺泉，床后三枝五枝树。\n眠闲图似在家山，梦魂不使东南去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和柳子玉官舍十首 其三 小池","author":"黄庶","text":"清泉数斛关幽事，坐见镜中鱼往来。\n浮萍蚀尽秋月面，霜为一磨如匣开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":73983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]